The SimpMusic sources are not part of this repository; the build script downloads them from
https://github.com/maxrave-dev/SimpMusic. The patches in patches/ modify those sources:
  2026-11-27: Include the GTK module and expose the Compose translations (01).
  2026-11-27: Keep libmpv loaded privately to prevent crashes in QuickJS (03).
  2026-11-27: Skip automatic lyrics and artwork requests from the GTK player (04).
The application icon (packaging/io.github.x_vlad_x.SimpMusicGtk.png) and most of the UI
translations come from SimpMusic.

